          "endChar": 548,
          "quote": "a base station unit, said base station unit generates at least one pair of orthogonal magnetic fields, each magnetic field being separately identifiable and having a principal axis, the principal axes being mutually directionally diverse and lying substantially within a common two-dimensional plane of operation"
